# User Story Writing Reference

Patterns, templates, and guidelines for converting BRD requirements into Jira-quality user stories.

---

## User Story Format

### Standard Template
```
As a [role/persona],
I want [feature/capability],
so that [benefit/outcome].
```

### Roles to Use (by context)
| Role | Use When |
|------|---------|
| `new consumer / new user` | Registration, onboarding flows |
| `existing member` | Transaction, redemption, scan flows |
| `market admin` | Configuration, toggle, Admin Panel features |
| `business owner` | Reporting, dashboards, revenue-related |
| `backend system` | Validation, fraud, API, deduplication |
| `QA tester` | UAT scenarios |
| `security officer / DPO` | PII, PDPA, encryption |
| `PM / program manager` | Sign-off, milestones, process |

---

## Description Field Structure

```
[User story sentence]

Business Rules:
- [Rule 1]
- [Rule 2]

Edge Cases:
- [Edge case 1 → outcome]
- [Edge case 2 → outcome]
```

