## Acceptance Criteria Patterns

### Format: Bullet list (plain text for Jira)
```
- [Condition] confirmed within [SLA]
- [Negative case] rejected with [reason code]
- [Notification] delivered within [time]
- [Report/log] records [fields]
```

### Common AC templates by module

**Registration / Enrollment:**
```
- Member created in [system] within [X] sec of [trigger]
- Duplicate [identifier] returns existing profile; no second record created
- Welcome notification delivered within 60 sec; includes [fields]
```

**Points / Scan Earning:**
```
- Points credited within [X] sec of successful [event]
- Ineligible [event] rejected; [REASON_CODE] logged; consumer shown error
- Balance updated in real time; visible in app within [X] sec
```

**Voucher Issuance:**
```
- Unique voucher generated and delivered within 60 sec of [trigger]
- Voucher value matches [configuration] for [brand/campaign]
- Second [trigger] for same consumer → no second voucher; [REASON_CODE] logged
```

**Fraud / Validation:**
```
- [Duplicate/Velocity/Invalid] [event] rejected; [REASON_CODE] logged
- [Threshold] enforced; breach triggers [action] within [time]
- Fraud alert visible in Admin dashboard within [X] min
```

**Admin / Configuration:**
```
- Config change effective within [X] hours of Admin Panel save
- Change log records: timestamp, admin ID, old value, new value
- [Behaviour A] when enabled; [Behaviour B] when disabled
```

**Notifications:**
```
- Notification delivered within 60 sec; channel priority: push → SMS → email
- Includes: [field1], [field2], [field3]
- Delivery rate ≥ [X]%; failures logged with retry
```

**NFR (Non-Functional):**
```
- [Operation] completes in < [X] sec at p95 under normal load
- Load test at [X] concurrent users passes within SLA
- Monthly uptime ≥ [X]%; downtime ≤ [Y] hours/month
```

**UAT:**
```
- [Test action] → [Expected system response] within [time]
- [Negative case] → [Expected rejection] with correct [reason/message]
```

